[Music]  i myself  cannot get vaccinated and that's why i  need other people around me to be  vaccinated so they can protect  me and others like me  my name is boris lava i'm from sofia  bulgaria i'm a two-time kidney  transplanted patient  my first transplantation was made when i  was nine years old in pakistan  at the time they were doing organ  transplants to children in bulgaria  my second transplantation was done two  years ago  in turkey and my grandmother became my  kidney donor  what is happening right now is  absolutely not new for me i had to  take very good care of my hygiene what  i'm touching  am i touching my face afterwards and so  on so i really started noticing these  things even back then  so i feel like now i'm a bit more  experienced let's say  [Music]  for example my colleagues decided to  also get the seasonal flu vaccine so i  can work in a safe and  protected environment for which i'm very  thankful  [Music]  i can protect myself by raising  awareness so others protect  themselves and by doing that they  protect me so  by the herd immunity life would have  been easier for sure if  more people were vaccinated because that  would mean that i wouldn't have to  skip school and stay at home by myself  for the whole winter  hopefully we achieve that someday so  more people like me don't have to feel  so isolated  vaccines work be curious and find your  information from trusted sources

